WEBVTT

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:10.000
Willy, the bot.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Dolly, the dot.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:14.800
John types: hi its john!!

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:14.800
And the human who types to them: John.

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:18.600
Willy and Dolly: So Sure

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:25.700
John types: just put it in misc. future me will sort it

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:47.200
John types: future me here. what is misc 7

00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:56.300
John types: lifes short. dessert first!

00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:56.100
Willy: On it!

00:01:05.900 --> 00:01:11.700
John types: ok im stuffed

00:01:10.300 --> 00:01:19.700
Willy: Don't worry. Future John is going to love this.

00:01:13.900 --> 00:01:19.700
Dolly: Is Future John also stuffed?

00:01:24.800 --> 00:01:29.200
John types: dont worry, my chips are all in

00:01:29.800 --> 00:01:33.200
Willy: All in!

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:46.200
John types: lol i meant like poker. honestly that works too

00:01:51.300 --> 00:01:57.100
John types: dont bother tidying. the tidy robots are coming

00:01:56.100 --> 00:01:59.900
Willy: I can't wait to meet them!

00:02:06.700 --> 00:02:11.700
Willy: We came!

00:02:20.800 --> 00:02:28.600
John types: everyone at work started smoking

00:02:22.600 --> 00:02:28.600
A coworker: the robots will fix it later

00:02:23.600 --> 00:02:28.600
A coworker: robots'll fix it

00:02:24.600 --> 00:02:28.600
A coworker: later, the robots

00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:46.200
Willy: We're still learning to fold socks.

00:02:52.300 --> 00:02:56.300
Dolly: Thanks for watching “So Sure”!

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:56.500
Willy: Next time: “Someplace Else”!

00:02:56.700 --> 00:03:00.700
